{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "画像は最大4枚までです。1枚20MB・合計80MBまで添付できます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can attach up to 4 images, 20 MB each and 80 MB in total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像は1枚あたり20MBまでです": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images are limited to 20 MB each."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像は合計80MBまでです": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images are limited to 80 MB in total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像は各辺8000ピクセルまでです。必要な部分を切り出してください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images must be at most 8,000 pixels per side. Crop to the area you need."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解像度を保ったまま送信容量に収まりません。必要な部分を切り出してください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The image exceeds the send limit at its original resolution. Crop to the area you need."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像を読み込めませんでした": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The image could not be loaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本文・添付・モデルが変更されたため、送信を中止しました": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sending was canceled because the text, attachments, or model changed."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
